1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Biografiska Uppgifter Elizabeth Gudmundsdotter Krook written by Oskar Valfrid Johansson Krok 1884 - 1921 gives her birthdate as 1660 but her parents married in 1664 and her brothers David and Jacob are at the U
2 CONC niversity at ages 8 and 9, so they are one year apart.  I believe David was born in 1665 and Jacob in 1666.  Elisabeth may have been born in1662 .She is godmother to her nephew's twins Abraham and Isak in Vaddo in 1733.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married January 1, 1683 in Hagby to Lars Wadensteen
2 CONT
