1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Sigrid Pedersdotter Bagge af Berga==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Peder Nilsson, till Berga (Bagge af Berga) and Bengta NN 
2 CONT
2 CONT == The noble family Bagge af Berga no. 118==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TAB 7'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Peder Nilsson (overview team1, son of Nils Jönsson, tab6), to Berga in Högsby parish Kalmar county. Was a child in 1399, but full authority 1412-04-18, when he, a resident of Västbo, pledged land to his uncle Tord Jönsson. Made ea
2 CONC rth change with the cousin Mikael Magnusson in 1418. Was gunner in 1423 and then lived Vrankunge. Stayed there 1429, but from 1432 on Berga. 1444-03-25 confirmed his uncle Magnus Jönsson's gift to Vadstena monastery and still live
2 CONC d 1463-12-04, when he gave Draghö (Drafö) in Ås parish in Västbo to Nydala monastery for his camp town and his parents' souls. His marriage is unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children:==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Carin Pedersdotter,'''. Married to the ruler Måns Nilsson (Stierna) to Säby, one of the ancestors of the noble family Stierna .
2 CONT * '''Brita Pedersdotter'''  Married to the gunman Joan Håkansson.
2 CONT * '''Sigrid Pedersdotter,''' Married to Olof Abjörnsson .
2 CONT * '''Måns Pedersson,''' Måns Pedersson (overview team1, son of Peder Nilsson, tab7), to Berga. Seals with the father's weapon a letter issued in Kalmar 1500-07-15 and is then called prosperous man 6 . Wrote to Husaby in Högsby par
2 CONC ish 2 1503-05-28 and received a letter of salvation from the Deputy Director Sten Sture dy 1517-02-29. Married before 1503 with Carin Bagge a v, daughter of Peder Bagge (of Botorp) . Their children called themselves Bagge, but ret
2 CONC ained the father's weapon, the spar over a leaf.
2 CONT * '''Kerstin Pedersdotter,''' Married to the gunman Per Månsson to Harstad, who carried a Snedbjälke in the weapon.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' The noble family Bagge af Berga no. 118, Tab 7 - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Bagge_af_Berga_nr_118#TAB_8
