1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Ragvald Håkansson (Båt av Billa)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Håkan Båt af Billa
2 CONT
2 CONT Issued together with his wife Elin with his father Håkan's consent letter in Virserums sn, Aspelands hd in Småland regarding land in Södra Möre hd in Småland. Possibly identical with Ragvald Rumpa, who died in 1421 and is then sta
2 CONC ted to have owned land in Aspelands hd.
2 CONT
2 CONT Only the daughter Katarina can be considered completely
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Ragvald+H%C3%A5kansson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_3364&tab=post SDHK no: 3364]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Swedish Diplomatarium's main catalog of medieval letters'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1325 November 15''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragvald Håkansson exchanges 10 ½ öresbol in Torp to Mr. Jon, priest in Stenkyrka (Tjörns hd), for the church's 5 öresbol in Krossekärr and 6 öresbol in Skår, with the obligation to pay an intermediate dowry.
2 CONT The issuer seals.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Ragvald+H%C3%A5kansson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=2&postid=sdhk_15560&tab=post SDHK no: 15560]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Swedish Diplomatarium's main catalog of medieval letters'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1401 January 30 Place of issue: Virserum''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragvald Håkansson and his wife Elin , with the consent of his (Ragvald's) father, give their daughter Katarina the farm Mölltorp near Karstorp in (Southern) Möre. The parish priest Birger in Virserum and Peter Ragvaldsson in Virst
2 CONC ad seal.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources,''' Post-medieval copies:  Lars Sparre's copy book, B 15 fol. 118, RA 0202
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://www.fredrikahlander.com/genealogy/p208ca8f5.html
2 CONT * https://sv.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/B%C3%A5t_av_Billa
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources= 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Almquist, Jan Eric (1957). Wernstedt Folke. ed. Boat by Billa . Older Swedish salvation families: genealogies. Bd 1. H. 3. Stockholm: Riddarhusdirektionen. page 218-222. Libris 12871
2 CONT
