1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Married 04 16 1669    Anna Bollja was daughter of Kettil Bollja in service in Riga.  Both he and his wife Sofia Brandtmoller died of the plague and Anna was taken to Sweden by her two uncles Bollja and brought up b
2 CONC y Ingridh Andersson Bollja and her husband  Claes Bollja.  The only time that Sofia Brandtmuller was in Sweden was for her mother in laws funeral - Brita Maneskold.  We can assume that Anna was therefore born in Riga. She was 8 ye
2 CONC ars old when her parents died.
