2 CONT whole time at the place in Boarp 102, property her father had purchased in
2 CONT 1690, near the cavalry regiment in Langaryd.  She was 47 years old when they
2 CONT married and Captain Flackman had no children of his own.  She died in Boarp  6
2 CONT Jan 1763 and was buried in Langaryd 2 Feb.  She was 3 weeks short of being 85
2 CONT years old.
2 CONT
