1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-65942241-1-16275/knut-mattsson-upplanning-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-edf26cefc8d2a755b1a5cfb79bf5048a&mrid=41eb3c262a1a1ea902541ab
