1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Häradshövding Petrus Petri Svenske=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Pehr Svenske'''', born in Stockholm in 1531. '''Parents''': '''Peder Larsson Svenske''', the castle lord in Kalmar, and his '''2nd''' wife Mrs. ''Ingeborg Månsdotter (Aries)'''. Student in Uppsala 1552, ordained priest 1559, 
2 CONC vicar of Höreda-Mellby 1569, died 1591.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married in 1560 to '''Karin Bröms,''' daughter of Lasse Bröms, courtier and Margareta Drake. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Abel''' ; Rider master in Ryssby skans in Småland;  Shortly afterwards killed by the Danes in 1610 or 11. He is called unsaved, probably because the father was a priest. 
2 CONT * '''Elin''' . Married to Goldsmith and Councilor in Mariæstad Sven Månsson ; grandfather of Assessor Sven Hasselbom, Nobil. Hasselbom, No. 1332. 
2 CONT * '''Anna,''' born in the 1580s. Married to Councilor in Brätte Börje Olofsson ; progenitor of nobility. the families Tigerhjelm , No. 817, and Carlström, No. ris 857 and 963. 
2 CONT * '''Beata''' , b. 1585, † 1645 14/4, three days before the husband. Married in 1603 to the Church Vicar in Höreda in Småland Petrus Nicolai Skarp , b. 1567, † 1645; father of First Lieutenant Isaac Gustaf Skarp, Nobil. Skarpenfel
2 CONC t (Skarp von Felt, No. 517). 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sv.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Petrus_Svenske#:~:text=Petrus%20Petri%20Svenske%2C%20f%C3%B6dd%201531,svensk%20pr%C3%A4st%20i%20H%C3%B6reda%20f%C3%B6rsamling '''Peter the Swede, Swedish Priest in Höreda, Sweden''']
2 CONT
2 CONT Petrus Petri Swedish, born in 1531in Stockholm, died in 1591 in Höreda congregation,Jönköping County, was a Swedepriestin Höreda parish.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Biography'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Petrus Svenske was born in 1531 in Stockholm . He was the son of the war colonel Peder Svenske in Vadstena . Svenske became a student at Uppsala University in 1552 and was ordained a priest in 1559. He became vicar in Höreda paris
2 CONC h in 1560 and died in 1591 in the parish. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Svenske married Karin Bröms in 1560. She belonged to an old noble family. Together they had a daughter, Beata Svenske, who married the parish priest Petrus Skarp in Höreda parish. After Svenske's death, Bröms remarried the parish 
2 CONC priest Johannes Brask in Höreda parish. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
