2 CONT * Johan Isak Håhl , Linköping diocese's herdaminne , vol. 3, 1847, p. 335, read: 5 March 2022. [source from Wikidata]
2 CONT * [ a b ] Håhl, Johan Isaac (1847). Linköping diocese's pastoral memory Part 3 . Norrköping. page 335. Libris 349898
