2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-17432582-12-607666/anund-persson-in-myheritage-family-trees?s=17432582&indId=individual-17432582-12606142 MyHeritage Family Trees] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCo
