1 OCCU Kyrkoherde i Ving, Skara stift
1 TITL Kyrkoherde
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kyrkoherde (Vica) och prost i Södra Ving åren 1569-1594.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joh. Ulfonis var pastor 1569 och erlade 1571 till Elfsborgs lösen ett k. Eriks gulden, en 1570 års krona, en daler, 15 lod silfver och 66 rdr i penningar. Han underskref liturgien 1577 och Ups. mötes beslut 1593; blef prost 1590 o
2 CONC ch dog 1594.  G. m. Ingegerd Olofsd:r, död 1612. Barn: Sara, död 1601, g. m. presidenten i Göteborg Nils Börjesson (Drakenberg). Beata, g. m. efterträdaren. 
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography (from "Skara stifts herdaminne"): Wing, Åhs Härad parish: "Joh. Ulfonis was pastor in 1569 and paid in 1571 to the ransom of Elfsborg one king Erik's guilder, a 1570 year crown, a daler, 15 lode silver, and 66 rdr in mon
2 CONC ey. He signed the liturgy in 1577 and the decision of the Upsalla meeting in 1593; became dean in 1590 and died in 1594. Married Ingegerd Olofsdrr, died in 1612. Children: Sara, died in 1601, married the president of Gothenburg Ni
2 CONC ls Börjesson (Drakenberg). Beata, married the successor [Haqvin. Benedicti]."
2 CONT
2 CONT A transcript of the "Confessio Fidei" (Confession of Faith) from the 1593 Uppsala Synod is at https://sv.wikisource.org/wiki/Uppsala_m%C3%B6tes_beslut_1593 Under "Kyrkioherdar på Landzbyghden j Westergöthland" signs "Iohannes Præp
2 CONC ositus & Pastor in Wing."
2 CONT
2 CONT "In the sacrisy [room of Södra Ving Church, Hökerum, Sweden] there is a board [painting] with all the famous priests who have served in the church, Among others, one of these, Johannes Ulfonis, was involved in signing the decision
2 CONC  of the Uppsala meeting in 1593, which was the most important church meeting of the Church of Sweden. It was Duke Charles who summoned the most distinguished and most learned of the clergy in the kingdom so that they could agree o
2 CONC n the guidelines for the future of the church."
2 CONT Link (accessed 21 May 2025, page archived at web.archive.org):
2 CONT https://www.mobileguide.se/3_08_2049_text.html and
2 CONT https://www.mobileguide.se/resources/So%CC%88dra-Vings-kyrka-(mobil).pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT Allan Anderson notes:
2 CONT My mm mm mm mm mm mm f,  also my mf mm mm mm mm mm f.
2 CONT Son-in-law was Haqvin Benedicti Krykoherd of Södra Ving parish.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Johan Wilhelm Warholm, "Skara stifts herdaminne" (1874), pp. 479-480, https://runeberg.org/skarahe2/0485.html and https://runeberg.org/skarahe2/0486.html
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LZDL-27J
2 CONT
2 CONT
