1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Från Runeberg.org ur Svenskt biografiskt handlexikon
2 CONT
2 CONT Ericus Scarinius 1655—67. Past. i Dala. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dahl, gammal prästsläkt från Västergötland,  härstammande från kyrkoh. i Dala Ericus  Christofori Scarinius, f. 1597, d. 1667, hvars  söner antogo namnet Dahl efter födelseorten.  En av sönernas halfbroder, Olof, upptog efter morf
2 CONC adern namnet  Kolmodin och var den bekante filologen, Olof  Kolmodin d. y. 
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT Allan Anderson notes:
2 CONT  M.P. / Dean Provost Ericus Christophori SCARINIUS
2 CONT             (Member of Parliment, Prost, kyrkoherde och riksdagsman i Dala.)
2 CONT Son of Christophoffer Scarenius 1572-16xx) pastor i Skara
2 CONT
2 CONT His daughter married Laurentius LARS Laurentius-Insulanus OTTER a Pastor i Broddetorp (R), whose Uncle was Johannes Lechander  Kyrkoherde i Bitterna.
2 CONT This uncle is my ancestor:my mm mm mm mm mf also my mf mm mm mm mf.
2 CONT
2 CONT Prost (Priest) i Fågelås-Riksdagsman, Västergötland.
2 CONT Anförlust två barn i anorna (Lost of two children in the ancestors).
2 CONT Barnen antog namnet Dahl (had 2 kids who assumed the name Dahl).
2 CONT
2 CONT Quote from Geni: "Dahl, an old family of priests from Västergötland, descended from the parish priest in Dala Ericus Christofori Scarinius, b. 1597, d. 1667, whose sons adopted the name Dahl after their birthplace. One of the sons
2 CONC ' half-brothers, Olof, took the name Kolmodin after their maternal grandfather and was the well-known philologist, Olof Kolmodin."
2 CONT
2 CONT From Gabriel Anrep, "Svenska Slägtboken," Första serien, Tredje bandet, (1871-1875), footnote on pp. 322-323 (translated from Swedish): "The Westgöta priestly family Dahl, known as far back as the Kolmodinska family, descends from
2 CONC  the vicar in Dala, Borgunda and Högstena, the contract vicar in Redvägs contract and in Dala, Åsled and Fogelås, magister Ericus Christophori Scarinius, born 1597 15/3 in Skara, where his father was a goldsmith, died 1667 14/5, i
2 CONC n Dala vicarage and married to Anna Håkansdotter, daughter of the vicar Haqvinus Benedieti in Wing in Ås district. Their children were called Dahl after the parish of their birth. The son Christopher Dahl, died 1714 16/9 and marri
2 CONC ed a daughter of the vicar Nicolaus Andres Bechius in Dala, and the grandson Erik Dahl, born 1679 3/2, died 1720 19/5 and married to Sara Hesselia from Folkärna in Dalarne, in her first marriage, were both also vicars in Dala. The
2 CONC  latter was the father of Christopher Dahl, married to Helena Elisabeth Kolmodin."
2 CONT
2 CONT From "Skara stift herdaminne," sednare delen (1874), pp. 296-297:
2 CONT "14. Mag. Ericus Christof. Scarinius, goldsmith's son from Skara, born on March 15, 1597, became a colleague at Skara school in 1623, presbyter in 1624; went to Uppsala Academy in 1626; vice-rector at Skara school in 1633, master 
2 CONC in 1632, theological lecturer in 1633; received full power of attorney for the Dala pastorate in 1639, "since he has famously performed the theological duties of the school for 8 years and wants to become the parish priest;" was i
2 CONC ntroduced in 1641; preached at the presbyter in 1642; became provost of Redväg district and Dala and Åsled in 1647, to which the Fogelås prostery was added in 1655. He was also an assistant in the consistory, signed in 1649 the na
2 CONC tional council. declaration of Carl Gustaf's succession to the crown of Sweden; member of parliament 1655. Died 14 May 3667. — A respected man.
2 CONT Married 1633 m. Anna, d:r of the priest. Haqv. Bened. in Wing A. h. The children were called Dahl. Christofer, pastor here. Hakan, stud. in Ups. 1661. Anna Beata b. 1635, g. m. priest. L. Otter in Broddetorp, Annika, d. 1703, g. m
2 CONC . horseman. And. Reutersvärd. Sara, g. m. lieutenant And. Amundsson.
2 CONT Printed work: Oratio Synodalis de Scriptura sacra eiusuue attributis, Ups. 1642."
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT "Skara stift herdaminne" Sednare delen, Dala kyrkoherdar, Mag. Ericus Christof. Scarinius, pp. 296-297, https://runeberg.org/skarahe1/0302.html and https://runeberg.org/skarahe1/0303.html
2 CONT Gabriel Anrep, "Svenska Slägtboken," Första serien, Tredje bandet, (1871-1875), footnote on pp. 322-323, https://runeberg.org/svslagtbok/1-3/0330.html and https://runeberg.org/svslagtbok/1-3/0331.html
2 CONT https://forum.rotter.se/index.php?topic=186694.0
