1 CONT 2- Notes on this record says that the data came from Swedish Histories C;
1 CONT p 171. These are presumably found in the Family History Library in SLC,       Ut.
1 CONT 3- Research from Elle Heckscher, Uppsulla, Sweden. Svenska Adelus Attantavlor. (Swedish nobility pedigree records)
1 CONT 4- Swedish Postal Address Book; Stake Family History Center.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- I am not sure how this family fits in as I cannot find a link in with the otherfamilies.
1 CONT
1 CONT 2- The birthplace name "Espas" is not in the postal book. There is a "Espnas" village in Brunflo parish, Jamtland county, Sweden. There is not a  farm or village by the name of "Espas" listed in Jonkoping parish or county.
