1 CONT 1- "Gönorsberg", Smaland, is an lg, or lägenhet ( name of an apartment house)  in Vederslöv, Kronoberg, Sweden. This is in the provence of Smaland. This  is where their son, Andres, was apprently born but it does not necessarily m
1 CONC ean that this appartment house was their birthplace. That is why the term "of" was used in the locality field.
