1 CONT p 171. These may be found in the Family History Library in SLC, Ut.
1 CONT 3- 1996: Swedish Postal Address Book; Stake Family History Center.
1 CONT
1 CONT NOTES:
1 CONT 1- There are no children listed on this FRG.
1 CONT 2- See her father's note section for details on the birthplace.
